1
00:00:00,830 --> 00:00:02,660
PENNY:
So how do you feel?

2
00:00:02,832 --> 00:00:05,832
(Penny:)Nice and loose? Come to play?
Got your game face on?

3
00:00:07,336 --> 00:00:09,046
(Penny:)- Are you ready?
ALL: Oh.

4
00:00:09,213 --> 00:00:12,003
Yeah. You don't have to stay
for the whole thing.

5
00:00:12,174 --> 00:00:14,884
(Penny:)Oh, no, no, I want to.
Sounds really interesting.

6
00:00:15,052 --> 00:00:16,092
(Raj:)Okay.

7
00:00:21,892 --> 00:00:23,312
(Penny:)- Gentlemen.
- Sheldon.

8
00:00:23,477 --> 00:00:26,647
(Howard:)- Sheldon.
- Hee-hee-hee.

9
00:00:28,107 --> 00:00:29,857
(Leonard:)Sheldon.

10
00:00:31,444 --> 00:00:33,324
I'm just gonna sit down.

11
00:00:37,032 --> 00:00:38,662
So is that your team?

12
00:00:38,993 --> 00:00:40,413
(Sheldon:)Actually, I don't need a team.

13
00:00:40,578 --> 00:00:44,538
(Sheldon:)I could easily defeat you single-handedly,
but the rules require four.

14
00:00:44,707 --> 00:00:49,007
So may I introduce the third-floor janitor,
the lady from the lunch room and...

15
00:00:49,170 --> 00:00:53,090
(Sheldon:)My Spanish is not good.
...either her son or her butcher.

16
00:00:53,716 --> 00:00:54,966
(Sheldon:)And what about your team?

17
00:00:55,134 --> 00:00:58,174
(Sheldon:)What rat have you recruited
to the S.S. Sinking Ship?

18
00:00:58,345 --> 00:01:03,025
LESLIE:
Hello, Sheldon.

